Package: IKUNML
Title: Configurable Machine Learning Feature Selection for Omics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Weigen", "Wu", email = "weigenwu@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A lightweight toolkit for configurable feature selection in
    transcriptomic and other omics-style classification data. IKUNML wraps
    LASSO/elastic net, Boruta, SVM-RFE/mSVM-RFE, random forest, gradient
    boosting, decision trees, XGBoost, caret RFE, and genetic algorithm feature
    selection behind a common interface, then summarizes overlaps across
    methods.
